# The bench scene (HELP): a frame built to the ported game's busiest
# numbers, every draw strategy in turn, then the table of times (EmuMD times
# the host, not the RP: the pictures are what count here).
expect hello ST hello #1: machine
expect bench bench: new ST session
sleep 2
key help
expect sweep scene: sweep of
sleep 3
shot scene-start
sleep 20
shot scene-later
expect done scene: sweep done
sleep 2
shot results
